{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o010b","title":"曹操表刘备为镇东将军","accounts":[{"id":"xianzhu-e-o010b-account","label":"《先主传》正文","text":"曹操表刘备为镇东将军，封宜城亭侯。","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o010b-q"]}],"participants":[{"person":"cao-cao","role":"表荐","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o010b-q"]},{"person":"liu-bei","role":"任官受封","evidence":["xianzhu-e-o010b-q"]}],"place":null,"time":{"year":196,"label":"建安元年","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"xianzhu-y196","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"xianzhu-q-o010","basis":"建安元年"},"evidence":["xianzhu-e-o010b-q","xianzhu-q-o010","wudi-q-o040","wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d"]},"source_order":[32,41,"O010b"],"order":6512}],"persons":[{"id":"cao-cao","name":"曹操","facts":[],"aliases":[]},{"id":"liu-bei","name":"刘备","facts":[],"aliases":[]}],"evidence":[{"id":"wudi-q-b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-16a5462151b1cfe5142d","layer":"modern","quote":"〖1〗建安元年：公元 196 年。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":264,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-df2756e12f4ac1fef3c4","start":0,"end":17,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wudi-q-o040","section":"chapter-001","block":"b-c71d10ef121af30ac6b7","layer":"original","quote":"建安元年春正月〖1〗，太祖军临武平〖2〗。袁术所置陈相袁嗣，降。太祖将迎天子，诸将或疑；荀彧、程昱劝之。乃遣曹洪将兵西迎。卫将军董承与袁术将苌奴拒险〖3〗，洪不得进。汝南、颍川黄巾何仪、刘辟、黄邵、何曼等〖4〗，众各数万。初应袁术，又附孙坚〖5〗。","section_title":"武帝纪第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0007_split_000.xhtml","index":258,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":124,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-e-o010b-q","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-41f463c31e36d9086831","layer":"original","quote":"曹公表先主为镇东将军，封宜城亭侯。是岁，建安元年也。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":22,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"xianzhu-q-o010","section":"chapter-032","block":"b-41f463c31e36d9086831","layer":"original","quote":"袁术来攻先主，先主拒之于盱眙、淮阴〖10〗。曹公表先主为镇东将军，封宜城亭侯。是岁，建安元年也。","section_title":"先主传第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0070.xhtml","index":40,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":48,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
